<% content_for :title, "Filing — Tinkerex" %>

<div class="page-head">
  <h1>Filing</h1>
  <%= link_to "Settings", settings_path, class: "btn ghost small" %>
</div>

<p class="muted">
  One card per subfolder the sweep creates under <code>Projects/&lt;your project&gt;/</code>: when a
  file lands loose in a project folder it is filed into the folder its extension names here, and an
  extension with no rule anywhere goes to <code>other</code>. A file already in <code>other</code>
  moves out on the next sweep once its extension gets a rule here.
</p>

<div class="filing-cards">
  <%= render partial: "folder_card", collection: @folders, as: :folder,
             locals: { by_folder: @by_folder } %>
</div>
